{v:'VER',what:'cw-quiethud (his order of 10-27, build the quiet hud, changes 2 3 4): in a raid the corner wallet card is gone and the backpack value draws once, the posture word shows only crouched, the stamina bar only below full and it fades, run info folds to its count and opens when a contract moves (its arrow opens it for good), and the belt caption is gone while the ammo card names the gun',
 run:function(){
